  "description": "<div style=\"font-family:Poppins;\"><div><p>🎳 About Flextro Gear.</p><p><br></p><p>At Flextro Gear, we build bowling roller bags for players who take their game seriously — league regulars, tournament competitors, and anyone who's tired of gear that quits before they do. </p><p>The Flextro V2 is our flagship bag, engineered around a modular 2+1 layout: two balls ride secure in the main compartment, with a detachable single-ball bag ready when you need to bring a third. Reinforced wheels handle every surface from lanes to parking lots, a dedicated shoe compartment fits up to size 14, and premium materials hold up season after season.</p><p>Built for bowlers. Backed by the details.</p><p class=\"font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal\"><strong>💰 How Affiliates Earn.</strong></p><p class=\"font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal\">Earn 12% commission on every sale you refer, tracked automatically through your unique affiliate link. Commissions are paid monthly via bank transfer once you reach the $100 minimum payout threshold. Cookie window: 30 days.</p><p class=\"font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal\"><strong>🏆 What Makes Us Different.</strong></p><p class=\"font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal\">Flextro is the only modular bowling bag on the market. Players can detach the single-ball bag for practice nights and attach it for tournaments- one bag system that adapts to every situation. We're an emerging brand with a growing fanbase and strong Amazon reviews from real bowlers.</p><p class=\"font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal\"><strong>📣 How to Promote Us.</strong></p><p class=\"font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal\">Share your affiliate link on YouTube, Instagram, TikTok, or your blog. Create unboxing videos, tournament vlogs, or gear reviews featuring the Flextro V2. We provide product images, links, and everything you need to get started. Top-performing affiliates receive a free Flextro V2 bag.</p><p class=\"font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal\"><strong>📩 Get Started.</strong></p><p class=\"font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal\">Sign up, grab your link, and start earning. We handle all fulfillment and customer support ,you share and earn.</p></div></div>",
